{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "pki-ra-collection-001",
    "name": "PKI-RA API",
    "description": "PKI Registration Authority — REST API collection.\n\n**Import order:**\n1. Import `pki-ra.postman_environment.json` as the Environment.\n2. Import this collection.\n3. Select **PKI-RA Local (h2 profile)** as the active environment.\n4. Start raservice with profile `h2` (`./gradlew :raservice:bootRun`).\n\n**Base URL:** `{{base_url}}` → `http://localhost:8083/ra-api`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },

  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:8083/ra-api",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Override via environment variable for flexibility"
    }
  ],

  "item": [

    {
      "name": "Admin",
      "description": "Endpoints under /api/admin/** — require ROLE_ADMIN (HTTP Basic: admin / admin123).",
      "item": [

        {
          "name": "Config",
          "description": "app_config cache management.",
          "item": [

            {
              "name": "✅  Refresh config cache (admin)",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json",
                    "type": "text"
                  },
                  {
                    "key": "Accept",
                    "value": "application/json",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "auth": {
                  "type": "basic",
                  "basic": [
                    { "key": "username", "value": "{{admin_username}}", "type": "string" },
                    { "key": "password", "value": "{{admin_password}}", "type": "string" },
                    { "key": "showPassword", "value": false, "type": "boolean" }
                  ]
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/admin/config/refresh",
                  "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "admin", "config", "refresh"]
                },
                "description": "**Hot-reloads the ConfigBean cache from the database.**\n\nFull flow:\n1. Admin updates rows in `app_config` (DB tool / migration script).\n2. Call this endpoint — no application restart required.\n3. All services reading `configBean.getValue(key)` see the new values immediately.\n\n**Auth:** HTTP Basic — `admin` / `admin123` (dev only).\n\n**Success response (200 OK):**\n```json\n{\n  \"count\": 6,\n  \"refreshedAt\": \"2025-05-25T10:32:11.456Z\",\n  \"triggeredBy\": \"admin\"\n}\n```"
              },
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "type": "text/javascript",
                    "exec": [
                      "// ── Status check ──────────────────────────────────────────",
                      "pm.test('Status is 200 OK', function () {",
                      "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                      "});",
                      "",
                      "// ── Content-Type ──────────────────────────────────────────",
                      "pm.test('Content-Type is application/json', function () {",
                      "    pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Content-Type'))",
                      "        .to.include('application/json');",
                      "});",
                      "",
                      "// ── Body shape ────────────────────────────────────────────",
                      "pm.test('Response has count, refreshedAt, triggeredBy', function () {",
                      "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                      "    pm.expect(body).to.have.property('count');",
                      "    pm.expect(body).to.have.property('refreshedAt');",
                      "    pm.expect(body).to.have.property('triggeredBy');",
                      "});",
                      "",
                      "// ── Field assertions ──────────────────────────────────────",
                      "pm.test('count is a positive integer', function () {",
                      "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                      "    pm.expect(body.count).to.be.a('number').and.to.be.above(0);",
                      "});",
                      "",
                      "pm.test('triggeredBy is admin', function () {",
                      "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                      "    pm.expect(body.triggeredBy).to.eql('admin');",
                      "});",
                      "",
                      "pm.test('refreshedAt is a valid ISO-8601 timestamp', function () {",
                      "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                      "    const ts = new Date(body.refreshedAt);",
                      "    pm.expect(isNaN(ts.getTime())).to.be.false;",
                      "});",
                      "",
                      "// ── Save to environment for follow-up requests ────────────",
                      "const body = pm.response.json();",
                      "pm.environment.set('last_refresh_count', body.count);",
                      "pm.environment.set('last_refresh_at',    body.refreshedAt);",
                      "console.log('Config refreshed →', JSON.stringify(body, null, 2));"
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "listen": "prerequest",
                  "script": {
                    "type": "text/javascript",
                    "exec": [
                      "console.log('Calling POST', pm.environment.get('base_url') + '/api/admin/config/refresh');",
                      "console.log('Auth: Basic', pm.environment.get('admin_username'), '/ ***');"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ],
              "response": [
                {
                  "name": "200 OK — cache refreshed",
                  "status": "OK",
                  "code": 200,
                  "originalRequest": {
                    "method": "POST",
                    "header": [
                      { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
                      { "key": "Accept",       "value": "application/json" },
                      { "key": "Authorization","value": "Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM=" }
                    ],
                    "url": {
                      "raw": "http://localhost:8083/ra-api/api/admin/config/refresh",
                      "host": ["http://localhost:8083"],
                      "path": ["ra-api", "api", "admin", "config", "refresh"]
                    }
                  },
                  "header": [
                    { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
                  ],
                  "body": "{\n  \"count\": 6,\n  \"refreshedAt\": \"2025-05-25T10:32:11.456789Z\",\n  \"triggeredBy\": \"admin\"\n}",
                  "_postman_previewlanguage": "json"
                },

                {
                  "name": "401 Unauthorized — missing/wrong credentials",
                  "status": "Unauthorized",
                  "code": 401,
                  "originalRequest": {
                    "method": "POST",
                    "header": [
                      { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
                    ],
                    "url": {
                      "raw": "http://localhost:8083/ra-api/api/admin/config/refresh",
                      "host": ["http://localhost:8083"],
                      "path": ["ra-api", "api", "admin", "config", "refresh"]
                    }
                  },
                  "header": [
                    { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
                  ],
                  "body": "{\n  \"status\": 401,\n  \"error\": \"Unauthorized\",\n  \"message\": \"Admin credentials required\"\n}",
                  "_postman_previewlanguage": "json"
                },

                {
                  "name": "403 Forbidden — authenticated but not ROLE_ADMIN",
                  "status": "Forbidden",
                  "code": 403,
                  "originalRequest": {
                    "method": "POST",
                    "header": [
                      { "key": "Accept",        "value": "application/json" },
                      { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Basic dXNlcjp1c2VyMTIz" }
                    ],
                    "url": {
                      "raw": "http://localhost:8083/ra-api/api/admin/config/refresh",
                      "host": ["http://localhost:8083"],
                      "path": ["ra-api", "api", "admin", "config", "refresh"]
                    }
                  },
                  "header": [
                    { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
                  ],
                  "body": "{\n  \"status\": 403,\n  \"error\": \"Forbidden\",\n  \"message\": \"ROLE_ADMIN is required\"\n}",
                  "_postman_previewlanguage": "json"
                }
              ]
            },

            {
              "name": "❌  Refresh — no credentials (expect 401)",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
                ],
                "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/admin/config/refresh",
                  "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "admin", "config", "refresh"]
                },
                "description": "**Security test — verifies that unauthenticated calls are rejected.**\n\nSends the request with **no Authorization header**.\n\n**Expected: 401 Unauthorized**\n```json\n{\n  \"status\": 401,\n  \"error\": \"Unauthorized\",\n  \"message\": \"Admin credentials required\"\n}\n```"
              },
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "type": "text/javascript",
                    "exec": [
                      "pm.test('Status is 401 Unauthorized', function () {",
                      "    pm.response.to.have.status(401);",
                      "});",
                      "",
                      "pm.test('Body contains status 401 and error field', function () {",
                      "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                      "    pm.expect(body.status).to.eql(401);",
                      "    pm.expect(body.error).to.eql('Unauthorized');",
                      "    pm.expect(body).to.have.property('message');",
                      "});"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ],
              "response": []
            },

            {
              "name": "❌  Refresh — wrong password (expect 401)",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
                ],
                "auth": {
                  "type": "basic",
                  "basic": [
                    { "key": "username", "value": "admin",      "type": "string" },
                    { "key": "password", "value": "wrongpassword", "type": "string" }
                  ]
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/admin/config/refresh",
                  "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "admin", "config", "refresh"]
                },
                "description": "**Security test — wrong password for the admin user.**\n\n**Expected: 401 Unauthorized**"
              },
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "type": "text/javascript",
                    "exec": [
                      "pm.test('Status is 401 for wrong password', function () {",
                      "    pm.response.to.have.status(401);",
                      "});"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ],
              "response": []
            }

          ]
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "name": "Health",
      "description": "Spring Boot Actuator — no authentication required.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/actuator/health",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["actuator", "health"]
            },
            "description": "Spring Boot Actuator health endpoint — confirms raservice is running."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Application status is UP', function () {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body.status).to.eql('UP');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 UP",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "body": "{\n  \"status\": \"UP\"\n}",
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }

  ]
}
